    "original_reconstruction": "For any natural n,D, any already-stored sequence of n+1 real D-by-(2D) local core tables, and arbitrary real length-D left/right vectors, ofTable returns a stored dependent real tensor chain of length n+1 with both boundary bonds 1. Its denotation exactly equals the chronological semantic boundary assembly whenever those finite tables match K on start,...,start+n. Its own synthetic charged operation total is at most 20D^2+30D+5n^2+7n+31 unconditionally. Its maximum bond is at most max(D,1) under the stated Window binder. For word (bit_0,...,bit_n), scalar coefficient = left^T K(start,bit_0) K(start+1,bit_1) ... K(start+n,bit_n) right. No conjugation, sign removal, normalization, approximation, or reversed matrix order. All 29 actual public definitions/theorems, exact signatures/bodies, expanded logical and typing inputs, cached-context bounds, operation counters and exclusions are retained in the bound artifact.",
